nteer refreshments at **$120.00** for this event.\n  - Correct approved amount is **$120.00** and **$25.00** must be disallowed.\n- **G-005 must be corrected from approve $310.00 to reject $0.00**.\n  - `04_expenses.csv` shows a single expense over $75.00 with **no receipt on file**.\n  - `01_allowability_rules.md` requires a receipt for any single expense over $75.00.\n  - Although the draft note said outreach printing supports the project, current rules do not allow reimbursement without the required receipt.\n- **Remaining amount under cap must be corrected**.\n  - The prior draft stated $145.00 remaining under a $2,000.00 cap.\n  - With the corrected $1,600.00 cap and corrected approved expenses, the remaining amount changes.\n\n## Omitted expense from the prior draft\n\n- The prior draft omitted **G-006 Final report postage**.\n  - `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` explicitly notes that final report postage was not included.\n  - `04_expenses.csv` lists G-006 for **$68.00**.\n  - `01_allowability_rules.md` makes public outreach postage eligible, and expenses of $75.00 or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.\n  - `04_expenses.csv` includes the ledger note: \"postal ledger entry under receipt threshold.\"\n\n## Controlling award cap source\n\n- **Controlling award cap: $1,600.00**.\n- **Source:** `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`.\n- **Why it controls:**\n  - `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` is newer than `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`.\n  - `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` says it **supersedes the original award cap for closeout purposes**.\n  - `01_allowability_rules.md` and `00_closeout_request.md` instruct use of the newest dated award document when award-cap sources conflict.\n\n## Evidence files used\n\n- `00_closeout_request.md`\n- `01_allowability_rules.md`\n- `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`\n- `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`\n- `04_expenses.csv`\n- `05_outcomes.md`\n- `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`\n- `prior_w